## 🔒 Security

Wishly is currently under development.

Authentication, API authorization, validation, privacy handling, and production security are being hardened before a public production release.

Never commit credentials, API secrets, access tokens, database credentials, or private environment configuration to the repository.

Use environment variables for sensitive configuration.

